- Tests `tests/render.lisp`: the nadir frame of piece 2''s GPU test now has a texture-coloured centre: the start''s sub-ship point (0° latitude, about 170° E from the Earth Rotation Angle at 2040-01-01 00:00 UTC; the test computes it with `latitude-longitude`) is open Pacific, blue above red.
