## Done when
- The seven pieces are done; `nix build` and `scripts/test` pass, `scripts/test` near its ~15 s.
- In a headless sim from a hand-placed start beside each place, the Mule can grapple a load, tow it, deliver it at Highport''s plant, berth at Tern Station, Fulmar Depot and Highport, refuel at the depots, bounce off and die against objects by the design''s numbers, deterministically through checkpoints.', '2026-10-15T06:14:24Z', 158);
