   - Done: tests pass; `docs/design.md` "Views" (the cockpit the default view), "Readability at 1280 × 800" (the measured contrasts), "Scope" → "Feature list" (the rows built); "GPU tests" and "Testing" (every check of this part and its bound); `AGENTS.md` (intro paragraph stays to part 13; "Run": the game opens in the cockpit, V to the outside view; "Layout": `cockpit.lisp`''s contents, the grapple camera in `render.lisp`).

