## Decisions to record (`pm decision record`)
- The player''s ship: parts and masses, main engine and RCS technology with thrust, Isp, propellant, Δv budget; the start orbit.
- Docking or grappling, and towing (in or out).
- Damage model (or none); refuelling and economy (or none); other ships on rails.

## Done when
- `docs/design.md` exists with all six top-level sections, the two above written, the others marked; every figure has its formula or source; the decisions are recorded and cited; `git add docs/design.md`.', '2026-10-14T17:58:38Z', '2026-10-14T18:08:33Z', 37, 0);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web) VALUES (39, 10, 'Design: flight controls, control modes, views, instruments and time warp', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-14, docs/design.md (Flight: controls, control modes, views, instruments, time warp); decisions 29, 30, 31', 'Second part of `plan 10: game design`: write the first half of the section "Flight" in `docs/design.md`: controls, control modes, views, instruments, time warp, as the plan body specifies.

