INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web) VALUES (188, 24, 'The sim''s grapple fields, notices, the SHIP log, the latest checkpoint and G, B, Y', 'work', 'done', NULL, '2026-10-15, src/clock.lisp, src/hazards.lisp, src/input.lisp, src/main.lisp, src/overlay.lisp, src/places.lisp, src/physics.lisp, src/prediction.lisp, src/flights.lisp, tests/clock.lisp, tests/hazards.lisp, tests/input.lisp, tests/overlay.lisp, docs/architecture.md, docs/design.md, AGENTS.md; decision 136', 'Piece 2 of `plan 24: Grapple, contact, berthing, towing, deliveries and refuelling` (read "The sim", "Input, the panel and the flash"). Needs piece 1 (`The stack and the ship''s collision shapes`) and `plan 23: Objects on rails and the Earth-orbit places`'' sim with objects (`task 185: The sim holds the objects: promotion, demotion and stepping`, `task 186: Removal and re-entry of objects`). Files: `src/clock.lisp`, `src/places.lisp`, `src/input.lisp`, `src/overlay.lisp`, `src/main.lisp`, their tests, `docs/architecture.md`, `docs/design.md`, `AGENTS.md`.

## What (`decision 112: Grapple, stack and berth in the sim: state, notices to the clock, the latest checkpoint`, `decision 113: Grapple and contact details the design leaves open`)
- Sim fields: `grapple` (state `:stowed`/`:armed`/`:closing`/`:latched`, object index, fixture index, relative pose vec3 + quaternion, closing end time), `berthed`, `transfer`, `excluded`, `delivery` (nil or an immutable list), `notices` (list of (key text)), `checkpoint-request`; copied by `copy-sim` and `sim-assign!` (conses nothing), `equalp` bit for bit.
