- Docs: "Assets" and "Files in load order" (`assets.lisp`, `text.lisp`, `shaders.lisp`) in `docs/architecture.md`; `docs/design.md` "Instruments and how each is drawn" (Fonts) names the files; `docs/luv-capabilities.md` "HUD and instruments" and `docs/luv-wishlist.md`''s world-text entry (copy''s size; a luv version: positions in the caller''s frame, the depth compare, a shared atlas over fonts).

