INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web) VALUES (232, 31, 'The cockpit view: eye, head look, V, exposure and the cab exterior hidden', 'work', 'open', NULL, NULL, 'Piece 2 of `plan 31: Text and the cockpit''s structure and view`; its "The cockpit view" section and piece 2 are the specification, `decision 126: Cockpit structure and view in milestone 3: frames, draw order, Slug text, head look, exposure, cab light, portholes, bezels, tape labels` the numbers (eye, limits, signs, gating, exposure 4.0). Builds on `decision 30: Views and cameras`, `decision 81: Input in milestone 2: held keys per frame, taps, gating and the shared key map`, `decision 82: Outside view camera: angles in a frame, toggles that keep the picture, distance and easing`, `decision 83: Map camera: framing on opening, focus, zoom, drag and exposure`, `decision 86: Death view, LOST panel and restart in milestone 2`, `decision 118: Autopilot preset menu and input in milestone 3` (V does not disengage the autopilot).

- `src/camera.lisp`: `*cockpit-eye*` (14.1, 0, −3.6) m from R, the `cockpit-view` struct (yaw, pitch, fov, target fov), `cockpit-view-reset!`, `cockpit-view-drag!`, `cockpit-view-zoom!`, `cockpit-camera-update!` (r + q (e − c), the CoM as `encode-ship` receives it; conses nothing), `cab-clip-rows!` (the same projection in body axes from the eye).
