- `src/main.lisp`: `game-cockpit-view`, `game-map-return-view`, `*default-view*` `:outside` (until part 10, `task 166`), the frame''s camera update, `game-restart!` to `*default-view*`; `:cockpit` also draws the minimal readout with a `PLACEHOLDER(166)` line (code and screen).
- `src/capture.lisp`: `capture-state :view :cockpit` (Home head, fov snapped, optional `:head`, `:interior`); `fly-screenshots` draws `:cockpit` (replace `PLACEHOLDER(165)` if `plan 28` left one).
- `scripts/screenshot`: `--view outside|cockpit|map` (default outside).
- Tests (piece 2''s list): `tests/camera.lisp`, `tests/meshes.lisp`, `tests/post.lisp`, `tests/input.lisp`, `tests/render.lisp` (GPU, the limb on the nose column), `tests/capture.lisp`.
- Docs: `docs/design.md` "Views" and "Controls" (V''s row, the title); `docs/architecture.md` "Files in load order" for the files above; `AGENTS.md` "Commands" (V in `nix run`, `scripts/screenshot --view`).

