- Tests: piece 2''s list in `tests/overlay.lisp`, with a model driven by `autopilot-key!` from the start state and at most one plan per test (`autopilot-plan-now` at `:point`). It includes the Hohmann 400 → 800 km rows, engaged past the first cut, a crafted `:station` plan, Backspace, an abort until Y, the 30-cell width and `glyph-missing` nil. `tests/cockpit.lisp`: rows 1–4 equal `autopilot-plan-lines`.
- Docs: `docs/design.md` "The autopilot" ("Picking a preset", "Showing the plan") as built; `docs/architecture.md` "Files in load order" (`overlay.lisp`, `cockpit.lisp`).

Done when: the tests pass; `nix build` and `scripts/test` pass.', '2026-10-15T07:52:20Z', NULL, 180, 0);
INSERT INTO task (id, plan_id, subject, kind, status, priority, note, body, created_at, retired_at, created_by_task, web) VALUES (247, 33, 'The autopilot panel drawn in the outside and map views', 'work', 'open', NULL, NULL, 'Piece 3 of `plan 33: The outside and map views'' overlay of milestone 3`. The plan''s piece 3 is the specification, together with `decision 129: Overlay of the outside and map views in milestone 3: the message line and the autopilot panel` (placement, draw order, capacity) and `decision 105: Readout box: placement, padding and the overlay''s capacity`. Needs the two previous tasks of this plan.

